    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d460">

                <pb facs="0398" n="388" xml:id="pg388"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6–1649</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of State of a
                        Conversation With the President</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-06-16">June 16, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chou En</hi>-<hi rendition="#small-caps">lai</hi>
                        “<hi rendition="#small-caps">Démarche</hi>”</p>
                <p>I brought the President up to date with respect to the Chou En-lai <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Démarche</hi> and read to him the pertinent sections of
                    our reply.<anchor n="36" xml:id="d460-f1"/> He approved this course of action
                    and directs us to be most careful not to indicate any softening toward the
                    Communists but to insist on judging their intentions by their actions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> E. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d460-f1" n="36" xml:id="d460-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 367, June 14, 5 p. m., <ref target="#pg384">p. 384</ref>.</p>
            </note>
